      <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;">
        <span class="foot-note num">142 de 148 marcados · R$ 6.089,20</span>
        <a href="#" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ff-warn);">14 na fila antes de gravar ›</a>
